 *   **Limitations:** Fixed step count may lead to aliasing or slow performance; requires full cube rasterization; precision issues with `RGBA16F` back-face texture if not careful [S1, S2, S3, unofficial].
-*   **When to use:** Real-time volume rendering in WebGL/OpenGL for moderate resolution volumes.
-*   **When not to use:** High-precision medical imaging requiring adaptive step sizes or complex clipping volumes.
 
